/**
 * @defgroup lexleo_vm_api lexleo_vm API
 * @ingroup api_reference
 *
 * @brief Public API for LexLeo VM construction, lifecycle, and runtime use.
 *
 * @details
 * This module provides the public APIs used to construct LexLeo VM handles,
 * manage their lifecycle, and run VM instances.
 *
 * The Composition Root API creates VM handles from configuration values and
 * borrowed runtime environments, then completes their default initialization
 * by creating internal owned runtime resources.
 *
 * The Composition Root API also destroys VM handles and releases the owned
 * runtime resources attached to them.
 *
 * Sub-APIs:
 * - @ref lexleo_vm_borrowers_api
 * - @ref lexleo_vm_cr_api
 */
